      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "f57bdb63d6394b4be28a76d6c76d22e348e52280ac3a406e0fdd622629a6946c",
      "text": "Transfer to the airport and flight to Iguazu. After arrival, tour of the Argentine side of the falls, with three trails through the 55,500-hectare park.\n\nLower Circuit · 1,700 metres of walkways into the jungle, close to the Dos Hermanas, Chico and Ramírez falls, down to the foot of the Salto Bossetti. Upper Circuit · A 1,300-metre elevated walkway along the edge of several major falls. Devil’s Throat · The Ecological Train leads to a 1,000-metre walk to the enormous Devil’s Throat.",
