    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:5a8704e80dc128a8",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "a8cb01ab3547e717f119743c5b8fd3b712dc044d02f74c363cf3418f0c443231",
      "text": "After breakfast, your guide takes you to the Brazilian side of the falls, along walkways bordering the canyon of the Iguaçu River, past hundreds of small waterfalls to the magnificent Devil’s Throat, the mightiest of all, where the spray lets you feel its grandeur among rainbows. After the excursion, transfer to the airport for your flight to Rio de Janeiro and to the hotel. Optional: Macuco Safari, helicopter flight or Bird Park (see Optional Excursions).\n\nMacuco Safari\n\nUSD 135 per person\n\nAbout 3 km through the jungle in an open jeep with a guide, then on foot to the river and by motorboat close to the falls.\n\nHelicopter over the falls\n\nUSD 170 per person\n\nThe power and beauty of the falls from a bird’s-eye view.\n\nBird Park\n\nUSD 65 per person\n\nHundreds of birds in 16.5 hectares of Atlantic Forest, immersive aviaries and a butterfly house.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_aligned",
        "fileId": "1VVb19fhYM4uGHIUqj8Vb14ySVdLL-qs9",
